<title>USA: Carolina Medicorp, N.C., yields 5.73 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Carolina Medicorp, N.C., yields 5.73 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it tentatively priced $104.3 million North Carolina Medical Care Commission bonds, for the Carolina Medicorp project, to yield 5.73 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
